{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>For your servant became surety.</b> The reason he will die upon seeing that the youth is not there, so that he asks what became of him, is that your servant became surety. And since I do not bring him back, he will suppose that he has perished without doubt, and because of this I could not fulfill my vow."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 44, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:34:35.210010908Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}